Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! Long time never talk! You really\Ndon't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiyoh, cannot recognise?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... David?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes lah! I changed number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eaten already? How is your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,First, they build trust. Money comes\Nlater.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Early investment allocation. Five thousand\Ntoday; good returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I invested too. I remembered you. Must be\Ntoday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For a moment, hope becomes stronger than\Ndoubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't miss it. Transfer first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Three thousand to release funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Another payment?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we lose five thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Money sent makes walking away harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,David, the investment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What investment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You called me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I never called you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.85,0:01:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Years to save. Minutes to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.75,0:01:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The scam did not begin when she\Ntransferred the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It began here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,One different decision could change\Neverything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! Long time never talk! You really\Ndon't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannot remember meh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,David, did you call from another number?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.95,0:01:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I didn't call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She stopped, checked, and verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Same call. Same scammer. One different\Ndecision.
